    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d554">

                <pb facs="0672" n="584" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg584"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lee to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-06-17"><hi rendition="#italic">June 17,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Lee reports that the negotiations for the delimitation of Panama, Colon, and
                    the canal zone have been completed, that maps <pb facs="0673" n="585"
                        xml:id="pg585"/> were made, and that General Davis, the minister for foreign
                    affairs, and the attorney-general of Panama signed the papers on the 16th
                    instant.)</p>
            </div>
